{
  "name": "Aid",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Choose up to three creatures within range. Each target's Hit Point maximum and current Hit Points increase by 5 for the duration.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. </strong>Each target's Hit Points increase by 5 for each spell slot level above 2.</p><p><em>Midi sample item.</em> The SRD Aid raises current hit points with a separate healing roll, which is capped at the maximum as it stands when the healing is applied: applied before the effect, a creature at full hit points gains nothing. This version has no healing roll; each level's effect raises temporary maximum hit points and, through DAE's <em>Also raise current HP</em>, current hit points by the same amount, once, whatever the order.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
